{
  "tutorial": {
    "id": 4261,
    "version": 2,
    "type": "course",
    "isNew": false,
    "codeLanguage": "javascript",
    "title": "Checking Number Equality",
    "descriptionContent": "Learn how to look for equality among numbers.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17163,
        "title": "Equality operator",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145228,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We learned how to create and store values, but how do we compare them?</p><p>In games, we compare numbers in situations like checking if the player's score matches the score needed to unlock the next level.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerScore = \" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreToUnlock = \" /><text value=\"1500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145229,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To compare if two numbers are the same, we use the <strong>equality operator</strong>, <code>===</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"2\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"5 === 5\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>=</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, and finally <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145230,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When comparing, there are only two results: <code>true</code> or <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145231,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When we compare the same numbers with the equality operator, the result is <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>3</code>, followed by <code>===</code>, and finally <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145232,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When we compare two different numbers with the equality operator, the result is <code>false</code>.</p><p>Pick the option that compares <code>9</code> to <code>10</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"9 = 10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>9 === 10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145233,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What do we use to check if two numbers are equal?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>===</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145234,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\"><code>false</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145235,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In which of these situations would we need to check if two numbers are equal?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">When checking if a player's health is <em>exactly</em> 0 (game over)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">When checking if a player's health is <em>less than or equal to</em> 20 (low health warning)</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">When checking if a player's health is <em>exactly</em> 0 (game over).</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145236,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>18</code> and then <code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>18</code> and then <code>513</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>18</code> and then <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145237,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Check if the value of <code>coins</code> is equal to <code>11</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"42\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coins = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(coins === \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>=</code> followed by <code>=</code> and then <code>=</code>, <code>11</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145238,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add the equality comparison operator.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145239,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Display <code>false</code> in the console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>13</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145240,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Check if these numbers are the same by typing <code>===</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"19\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" === \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17164,
        "title": "Inequality operator",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145241,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To check if a value in a game isn't equal to another value, we use the <strong>inequality operator</strong>, <code>!==</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145242,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We can store the result of a comparison with the inequality operator in a variable.</p><p>Save the comparison between <code>playerLives</code> and <code>maxLives</code> into the variable <code>result</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerLives = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" maxLives = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = playerLives !== maxLives;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>=</code>, followed by <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145243,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variables can store the result of equality comparisons, too.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"78\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentState = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pausedState = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = currentState === pausedState;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>=</code>, followed by <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145244,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We can compare values with variables and variables with other variables.</p><p>Type <code>===</code> to compare the contents of the variables.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"73\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerScore = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" targetScore = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerScore === targetScore);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerScore !== targetScore);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145245,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which value should <code>playerHealth</code> have, so that the comparison in the <code>isFullHealth</code> variable gives <code>false</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = ? ;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isFullHealth = playerHealth === \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>78</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>100</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>78</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145246,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145247,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What value should we give to the variable <code>coins</code> to store <code>true</code> in <code>hasMaxCoins</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coins = ? ; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasMaxCoins = coins === \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1000</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>67</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>1000</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145248,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What should the value of <code>playerScore</code> be if we want <code>equal</code> to be <code>true</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerScore = ? ;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highScore = \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" equal = playerScore === highScore;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>80</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>80</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145249,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add the operator that makes the comparison <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" !== \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145250,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Check if the player's <code>ammo</code> equals <code>13</code> and store the result in the <code>correctAmmo</code> variable.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"correctAnswer\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ammo = \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" correctAmmo = ammo === \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(correctAmmo);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>=</code>, followed by <code>===</code>, and finally <code>13</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145251,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Check if the player's current <code>level</code> equals <code>bossLevel</code> by typing <code>===</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"60\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bossLevel = \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(level === bossLevel);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>===</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145252,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Check if the player's name isn't empty by typing <code>!==</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"55\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" nameLength = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" validName = nameLength !== \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>!==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}